@startuml classification_activity_no_storage
title Classification Agent - Activity Diagram (No Storage Lifelines)
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive URL from orchestrator;
:Compile classification prompt\nwith route-only contract;
:Open classification browser profile;
:Navigate to URL and inspect rendered page;
if (popup or overlay dominates?) then (yes)
  :Use safest same-page close/continue control;
  :Inspect page again;
else (no)
endif

while (page type is not justified\nand tool budget remains?) is (yes)
  :Read broad context or scoped element/frame detail;
  :Compare URL, title, layout,\nmedia/frame signals, and visible text;
endwhile (ready or budget exhausted)

if (landing signals dominate?) then (yes)
  :Return landing_page;
elseif (watch/server host signals dominate?) then (yes)
  :Return host_page;
elseif (direct player/iframe page is proven?) then (yes)
  :Return embed_video_page;
else (unknown)
  :Return other;
endif
:Include confidence and concise evidence reasoning;
stop
@enduml
